          "value": "Rapala Trophies is a fishing simulation for PSP where players set up fishing by piloting a boat to fishing spots, then cast and work the lure to attract fish. Hooking a catch involves reeling in while managing line tension and drag, with the game switching views during the fight so players can track how the fish responds.\n\nThe game emphasizes selecting tackle and fishing strategy to target different species across a variety of locations.",
